      "text": "Postgres(more familiar & ACID)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Postgres(more familiar & ACID)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lr2h_emXQHTNTLzYUCxH0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3212.9429804196097,
      "y": 2258.7111983042623,
      "width": 674.4795532226562,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 737393372,
      "version": 997,
      "versionNonce": 1078107143,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795014337424,
      "created": 1794735766930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow 1 \nBuy Subscription\n1) Get userId from JWT\nTransaction\n2) Check is plan and voucher valid\n3) Create PENDING Subscription\n4) Create PENDING Payment\n5) Create Billings to save user payment details\nEND\n4) call external Payment Service\nASYNCHRONOUS\n5) Receive Success/Failed Webhook\n6) Worker/Handler receive and process\nTransaction\n7) Lock Subscription, Payment, Bills\n8) Reconcile and check subscription status, payment status\n9) Update subscription -> SUCCESS, Payment -> SUCCESS\n10) save a transactional outbox event for voucher issue/notification\nEND\n11) Return Success msg to user\n\nFlow 2\nAuto Renew\n1) Cron Job fetch subscription where end_at & \nstatus = ACTIVE, auto_renew=TRUE\nTransaction\n2) Create Pending Payment\n3) Lock Subscription, Billing\n4) Check condition\n5) Update subcription -> RENEWING\nEND\nCall External Payment Service\nSame with flow 1\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow 1 \nBuy Subscription\n1) Get userId from JWT\nTransaction\n2) Check is plan and voucher valid\n3) Create PENDING Subscription\n4) Create PENDING Payment\n5) Create Billings to save user payment details\nEND\n4) call external Payment Service\nASYNCHRONOUS\n5) Receive Success/Failed Webhook\n6) Worker/Handler receive and process\nTransaction\n7) Lock Subscription, Payment, Bills\n8) Reconcile and check subscription status, payment status\n9) Update subscription -> SUCCESS, Payment -> SUCCESS\n10) save a transactional outbox event for voucher issue/notification\nEND\n11) Return Success msg to user\n\nFlow 2\nAuto Renew\n1) Cron Job fetch subscription where end_at & \nstatus = ACTIVE, auto_renew=TRUE\nTransaction\n2) Create Pending Payment\n3) Lock Subscription, Billing\n4) Check condition\n5) Update subcription -> RENEWING\nEND\nCall External Payment Service\nSame with flow 1\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-bbfzTM-Eatx1Y3I1UjSF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4589.957464060349,
      "y": 1455.9884262416704,
      "width": 395.53973388671875,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 152379868,
      "version": 648,
      "versionNonce": 1338657769,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795014337424,
      "created": 1794735895704,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plans\n- id\n- start_period\n- end_period\n\nSubscriptions\n- id\n- userId INDEX\n- planId\n- start_from\n- end_at\n- version -> after renew advance\n- status\n- auto_renew\n\nBillings\n- id\n- userId INDEX\n- paymentDetails(i m not so sure)\n\nPayments\n- id\n- ref_no UNIQUE\n- subscription_id\n- billing_id\n- amount\n- currency\n- status\n\nVouchers\n- id\n- code\n- payment_id\n- user_id\n- status -> NEW | USED\n(Pre created like 300 row in voucher db)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Plans\n- id\n- start_period\n- end_period\n\nSubscriptions\n- id\n- userId INDEX\n- planId\n- start_from\n- end_at\n- version -> after renew advance\n- status\n- auto_renew\n\nBillings\n- id\n- userId INDEX\n- paymentDetails(i m not so sure)\n\nPayments\n- id\n- ref_no UNIQUE\n- subscription_id\n- billing_id\n- amount\n- currency\n- status\n\nVouchers\n- id\n- code\n- payment_id\n- user_id\n- status -> NEW | USED\n(Pre created like 300 row in voucher db)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
