    {
      "id": "pFXkwkd2FfsMMY3XOaHz7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4242.686481049914,
      "y": 942.3563192755192,
      "width": 665.7393798828125,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 85106375,
      "version": 521,
      "versionNonce": 162979401,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795062534743,
      "created": 1795059585410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional req:\n1) Limit transfer based on user balance, daily limit and prior transfer\n2) Customer configure the daily limit, resetting at 12am.\n3) Prevent Overdraft\n\nNFR :\n1) Scalability : 5M Transaction Per day, 2000QPS on peak\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Strong consistency\n4) Low latency p99 100ms\n5) Reliability\n6) Secuirty\n\nCore Entity:\n1) Configuration\n2) DailyUsage\n3) ReservationRecord\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional req:\n1) Limit transfer based on user balance, daily limit and prior transfer\n2) Customer configure the daily limit, resetting at 12am.\n3) Prevent Overdraft\n\nNFR :\n1) Scalability : 5M Transaction Per day, 2000QPS on peak\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Strong consistency\n4) Low latency p99 100ms\n5) Reliability\n6) Secuirty\n\nCore Entity:\n1) Configuration\n2) DailyUsage\n3) ReservationRecord\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Ket4_v4JsqPG-qbPoEoGe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4243.402688607595,
      "y": 1398.2624985870505,
      "width": 495.6396484375,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 597271463,
      "version": 311,
      "versionNonce": 1867723879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795062491292,
      "created": 1795060108119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Design\ngRPC endpoint\ncheckLimit(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key: requestId\nResponse=>{\n    currentBalance,\n    availableBalance,\n    transferAmount,\n    dailyLimit,\n    availableLimit,\n    tier,\n    decision    \n}\n\nrollbackReservation(userId, paymentId, requestID)\nIdemp-key : paymentId\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Design\ngRPC endpoint\ncheckLimit(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key: requestId\nResponse=>{\n    currentBalance,\n    availableBalance,\n    transferAmount,\n    dailyLimit,\n    availableLimit,\n    tier,\n    decision    \n}\n\nrollbackReservation(userId, paymentId, requestID)\nIdemp-key : paymentId\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
